      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Outbound 零信任凭证剥离与重入保护\nstdio 派生前 build_scrubbed_env() 剥离主密钥\n支持本地 stdio 子进程流与远端 streamable-http\n未知重入返 execution_unknown · redact_secrets",
