      "seed": 2135677953,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1683810637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "核心工程要点：① 双平面严格隔离同步阻塞线程 (asyncio.shield + to_thread) 与事件循环原生协程 (subagent_run / mcp__*)；② 静态 _workers 与动态 subagent_run 均复用全量 canonical_tools 实现 100% 根前缀 KV Cache 共享；③ McpClientManager 单宿主 _owner_task 彻底根治 AnyIO 跨任务退栈崩溃。",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "核心工程要点：① 双平面严格隔离同步阻塞线程 (asyncio.shield + to_thread) 与事件循环原生协程 (subagent_run / mcp__*)；② 静态 _workers 与动态 subagent_run 均复用全量 canonical_tools 实现 100% 根前缀 KV Cache 共享；③ McpClientManager 单宿主 _owner_task 彻底根治 AnyIO 跨任务退栈崩溃。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
